Bubble Zoom detection model
===========================

This directory bundles a speech-bubble detection model used by the reader's
"Bubble Zoom" feature.

Source model
------------
  Name:     comic-speech-bubble-detector-yolov8m
  Author:   ogkalu
  Upstream: https://huggingface.co/ogkalu/comic-speech-bubble-detector-yolov8m
  Commit:   21d5af0a9c69bb522b9968d6cc915f898d71a264
  License:  Apache License 2.0 (see the LICENSE file in this directory)

Bundled artifact(s)
-------------------
  bubble_detector.onnx   - int8 ONNX export of the model above, produced with
                           Ultralytics `YOLO(...).export(format="onnx", imgsz=640,
                           int8=True)` on a mixed manga/comic calibration set.
                           (A `bubble_detector.tflite` int8 export may be bundled
                           alongside for the alternative TensorFlow Lite engine.)

The exports are derivative works of the source model and are redistributed
under the same Apache License 2.0. No changes were made to the model
architecture or trained weights beyond quantization for on-device inference.
